# dev

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Query results — NEVER commit BLM case data to this repository.
# This repo is PUBLIC (verified 2026-08-07: visibility=public). Query outputs
# contain live case data: serial numbers, case names, dispositions, legal land
# descriptions. The VS Code CSV task writes to E:\Xentity\BLM\Query_Results\
# (outside this tree); these rules are a second layer of protection in case an
# output is ever pointed at the repo folder.
# NOTE: existing tracked files (e.g. web-app/*.csv) are unaffected — .gitignore
# does not untrack files already committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*_results.csv
*_results_*.csv
/Query_Results/
query_results/
*.results.csv
